# Affine polynomial-image dimension

Reusable bridges from coordinate-ring, transcendence-degree, and Jacobian
certificates to exact affine Zariski dimension over the complex numbers,
together with the underlying closure, irreducibility, affine-space,
polynomial-retract, affine-subspace, and dense-image theory.
It also includes finite-range rigidity on irreducible sets and endpoint-fixed
codimension-one certificates.
